// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Captain Mako 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2085354169" "Captain Mako"
// ProfessionString :
"P2374232261" "Seer of Paragon City"
// DescriptionString :
"P4087002031" "This is the description of Sister Psyche"
// LocationString :
"P3295827624" "The Crucible"
// HelloString :
"P1097992599" "Hello."
// HelloString :
"P3135390668" "Hi."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2014967038" "Gracious me!  It seems that I am experiencing the oddest of errors at this moment."
// IntroString :
"P612594318" "There's someone I want you to meet.  Here is their contact information.  I think you would be inclined to work with them."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3751841202" "Meet New Contact"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3776541590" "This contact I have introduced you to can probably move you along down the path you have chosen."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3342444154" "I have got someone I think you should meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P30252022" "There are a couple of people you should talk to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page HelloPage Text :
"P1267211751" "LISTEN UP, GUPPIES!!!  THE FIRST TO SWIM TO THE OTHER SIDE WILL WIN ALL OF MY PATRON POWERS!  THE LOSER WILL DIE BY MY HANDS!<br><br><color orange>Mako talks to you out of the corner of his mouth:</color><br><br>Heh... I don't know about you, but *my* favorite part is watching the look on the winner's face when he realizes that I was lying.  They both die."
// Answer Text :
"P3068301471" "Doing anything other than torturing these punks?"
// Answer Text :
"P3576640883" "Keep up the good work, Mako."
// Page StrikeForcePage Text :
"P4005847288" "Yeah, I've got something else that needs to be done.  Step through that portal beside me and go talk with Barracuda.  I'm sure she's up to something right now.  And bring some friends."
// Answer Text :
"P363959328" "Sure.  I'll go see what Mistral is up to."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


