"P2388704429" "HAR HAR HAR!!!  DANCE LITTLE MONKEYS, DANCE!!!<br><br>What're you doin' here, {VillainName}?  You here to play with these toys, too? <br><br>Well go find some of your own!  These ones are mine! <br><br><color orange>Black Scorpion looks like a thought passed through his head due to the painful expression that crossed his face.</color><br><br>Um... I mean... these 'candidates' are mine to... um... accustomify to our stricturated idealifications to be in Arachnos.<br><br><color orange>Whispers to you...</color>That's what we gotta say to them, right?"
// Answer Text :
"P4038633365" "Doing anything other than making these punks dance?"
// Answer Text :
"P3649429660" "Close enough, Black Scorpion.  Close enough."
// Page StrikeForcePage Text :
"P457723750" "Yeah, I've got something else that needs to be done.  Step through that portal beside me and go talk with Mantis.  I'm sure she's up to something right now.  And bring some friends."
// Answer Text :
"P3976258724" "Sure.  I'll go see what Mantis is up to."
