"P3407405131" "{VillainName}.  I didn't expect to see you here within The Crucible.  Have you come to play with these lives?  Or perhaps suffer through mindless worship?  Or perhaps something even more sinister, hmmm?<br><br>No, no, no... That's not it, now is it?<br><br>Yes... I believe you're aware that the tests of The Crucible aren't just for the 'candidates' alone..."
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
"P1542721104" "I think I'll keep my observations to myself, thank you."
// Page StrikeForcePage Text :
"P326646401" "Yes, I've got something else that needs to be done.  Step through that portal beside me and go talk with Lord Recluse.  I'm certain he could...use you.  And bring some friends."
// Answer Text :
"P1935774631" "Sure.  I'll go speak with Lord Recluse."
