"P3121913722" "{VillainName}!  Have you decided to grace us with your presence in The Crucible as a matter of business - or pleasure?<br><br>It matters not to me.  Do as you please shall be all that matters, as far as the laws of Arachnos are concerned.<br><br><color orange>The Arbiter quietly chuckles.</color><br><br>Well, for people such as you and I, that is.  It's such a shame these 'candidates' never had a chance to be admitted into Arachnos before they even stepped through these doors."
// Answer Text :
// Answer Text :
"P3796814654" "A shame for them, you mean.  Not for us..."
// Page StrikeForcePage Text :
"P2424799354" "Yesss... I've got something else that needs to be done.  Step through that portal beside me and go talk with Renault  I'm sure he's up to something right now.  And bring some friends."
// Answer Text :
"P3892840638" "Sure.  I'll go see what Renault is up to."
